        "en": "Place Lu Cun / Qing Yang / Tuo Luo / Kui Yue"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-TW": "祿存依年干；擎羊在祿存前一位、陀羅在祿存後一位；天魁天鉞依年干貴人歌訣。"
      },
      "inputs": [
        "ganzhi.year.stem"
      ],
      "logic": {
        "executor": "calcAuxByYearStem",
        "params": {
          "tableRef": "stars/aux-tables#byYearStem"
